what's going on guys in this video i'll  be breaking down the 13th opening for  black clover which is being used for the  spade kingdom arc which is now started  in the anime  we'll be talking about the visuals and  the significance of certain moments  but regarding the actual song itself  this was a song called grandeur and it  was very upbeat  which is not something you'd typically  expect from an arc like this  however it does work really well when  paired with the visuals  i do prefer it to the previous two songs  that we had for openings 11 and 12  but you know i still like those ones as  well i just think this one is better  than those  before we get into the breakdown there  will be big spoilers in this video  because  the opening itself contains many  references to spoilers and it'll just be  impossible to talk about it properly  without going into it  if you're an anime only watcher for  black clover and you don't read the  manga  then i 100 recommend that you stop  watching this video  but be sure to subscribe because there  will be more non-spoilery videos  coming on this channel for the spay  kingdom arc with that said  let's get into it and first place to  start is the is the beginning  with astor walking through the strange  hallway with candles surrounding him  this scene had a strong red aura and  this shade of red is the same color we  see whenever aston's devil appears  the only occasion in the manga where  candles were surrounding asta on the  ground like this was when he was about  to perform the devil binding ritual  to properly gain control over his devil  and you know harness the power of his  anti-magic abilities  this opening scene is a reference to  that ritual and therefore it makes sense  that the red aura of the devil should be  illuminating the scene  additionally this moment is also a  parallel to black clover's first ever  opening  where we saw a younger aster walking in  the same way before the scene pauses on  his face  and has this black and white type of  effect and the same effect can be seen  in the 13th opening  which is obviously an intentional  mirroring of the first one so  it's kind of meant to show us how much  he's grown in the 157 episode since we  first saw  the original opening things then move  over to asta flying through the sky on  his demon slayer sword  as funeral watches on in amazement from  the ground this is a throwback to  chapter 232  when finro couldn't help but admire  astor's progress from someone who had no  magic and couldn't even fly on a broom  to what he is today we then got a few  character shots featuring those who were  training in the heart kingdom  before switching over to yuno who stands  atop of the golden dawn staircase  we've seen in the past how typically  only the captain or vice captain of the  golden dawn will stand on top of this  staircase  and during the filler for those who  missed it yuna was promoted to a first  class senior magic knight  with the old vice captain longress  having now left the golden dawn for the  time being at least  yuno is therefore the new vice captain  which is why he's standing where he is  after this we get a brief shot of a  mysterious woman and for any anime  owners who didn't listen to my previous  spoiler warning  pause the video now and do not go any  further as manga readers will know  this moment is a flashback to the past  in which ass's mother was about to die  and it's immediately followed by a one  second clip of a devil possessed aster  just going berserk  the rage in this moment isn't just  astor's rage but it's also the anger of  the devil inside him  because we now know that astor's devil  did have a mother-son relationship  with astor's mother as weird as that  sounds i mean they're basically step  brothers  this scene is interspersed with a  glimpse of yuno's mother and a flashback  image of xenon from the dark triad  during the night in which the dark triad  killed the spade kingdom royal family  even though in the anime he doesn't know  it yet this is the moment that changed  juno's life because  without this attack you know probably  would have been the prince of the spay  kingdom by now  who knows he might have even been the  king of the spade kingdom if his father  had died  so it's just interesting to see this  scene here we then briefly see a present  day you know screaming in anguish  which was a scene directly from the  manga after the golden dawn  had been totally wrecked by xenon  speaking of the dark triad  they immediately appear after this  moment and it was really interesting to  see xenon's facial expression here  as he appears genuinely shocked by  something he's still smiling so whatever  he's discovered is you know  is information that still makes him  happy but there's two possibilities that  i see  the most likely possibility is that  xenon's expression  is referring to the time when he faced  off against yuno at the golden dawn  headquarters  and i say that because it's the only  moment in the series in which xenon has  genuinely smiled  on the other hand this could be  referencing something that might be  revealed in the future  that even manga readers haven't seen yet  because i wouldn't rule it out i mean  this opening  already reveals some things quite far  into the spade kingdom arc  so who knows maybe there's something  else that will make xenon smile like  this  it was interesting to see lucifero get  his own individual moment in this  opening  because based on everything we know so  far he is the strongest devil and the  true villain of this arc  the way i see it dante and the rest of  the dark triad are simply  vessels that the devils are using to  fulfill their goal of entering the human  world  if lucifero is successful in his plan  then i don't think he'd have much need  for the dark triad after that's done  astor is then seen fighting against some  random spay kingdom people  before the opening gives us the real  thing we've been waiting for which is a  preview of the three main fights from  the beginning of this arc  universe's xenon looks like it's going  to be great and i love the way that you  know spirit dive is animated in this  brief moment  noel versus vanika also got some screen  time as well as the first ever anime  look  at her mermaid form valkyrie armor  aesthetically it looks a lot better for  various reasons  but that's just my opinion the final  fight was a preview of yammy vs dante  and as you can see yami is in the  position to do his  death thrust spell which absolutely blew  everyone's minds when it was first shown  in the manga  so i can't wait to see how the fandom  reacts to this being an animated form  we can see dante in the background with  his 80 devil form  and uh yeah that's all there is to say  for now but obviously as the anime  progresses we'll see the form in its  entirety  as the opening comes to a close we get a  good look at the tree of clipboth  i think that's how you say it and this  will connect the underworld to the human  world and allow the devils to cross over  the heart kingdom queen then falls down  in the same manner as he did  in the cover for volume 26 and then  surprisingly  our boy knocked makes an appearance i  honestly wasn't expecting him to make a  significant appearance in this opening  but you know there he is with his shadow  magic and judging by the ground i'm  pretty sure  that this is the moment when he first  approached asta i feel like this opening  has an unusual amount of spoilers  especially if you compare it to the uh i  don't know the last few openings for  black clover  this one definitely has way more  spoilers in it than usual  there's then this epic shot of astor's  arm transforming into the devil arm that  he currently has  and i love the way his arm just breaks  apart and then is transformed into this  new thing  but if you forgot this was part of an  exchange that aston made with his devil  to gain the power he needed during an  emergency  i thought the opening was going to end  with this shot of aston yami  but surprisingly it continued on to  literally show us aston's devil in his  true form  and then another blurry glimpse of  astor's mother what do you guys think do  you agree with me like were there  too many spoilers in this opening or do  you think that anime only viewers won't  really understand it because there's not  enough context  whatever you think let me know down  below and don't forget to sub as i will  be doing more black clothing videos  as the spade kingdom arc continues i'd  appreciate if you dropped a like if you  liked this video  and until the next one peace out
 

